#C(168,005)|End of Turn|
#G(384,030,032,030)016(016,053)
#F015
#L(048,050)|Your army has run out of|
#L(048,070)|movement!  If you have no other|
#L(016,090)|armies to move it is the end of your turn.|
#F007
#L(016,110)|To end your turn, select "End Turn"|
#L(016,130)|from the "Turn" menu.|
#L(016,150)|Your opponent will move, and then it|
#L(016,170)|will be your turn again.  Any new armies|
#L(016,190)|will be produced, and your hero will have|
#L(016,210)|his full movement allowance restored.|
#F015
#L(016,235)|This procedure is the same throughout|
#L(016,255)|the game|
#L(016,275)|1. Move and fight|
#L(016,295)|2. End Turn|
#L(016,315)|3. Opponents move - one by one|
#E

